		<profileDesc>
			<abstract><p>A Gǝʿǝz grammar written in Ethiopia by <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS9683Urbino">Father Giusto da Urbino (Jacopo Curtopassi)</persName>
      in <date>1850-1854</date>. Composed of 40 lessons,
      it includes examples of the epistolary genre and dialogues in Gǝʿǝz.
      </p></abstract>
